WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.087
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:44.357 --> 00:48.069
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

3
01:25.648 --> 01:27.650
‎It's not turning out as neat as I hoped.

4
01:32.906 --> 01:34.699
‎Should I have done it in cursive?

5
01:36.618 --> 01:38.953
‎Still, this isn't bad.

6
01:51.591 --> 01:52.675
‎Dr. Gye.

7
01:53.509 --> 01:55.053
‎What is this

8
01:55.970 --> 01:57.388
‎that I'm looking at?

9
02:00.850 --> 02:02.101
‎Photos.

10
02:02.185 --> 02:03.019
‎What?

11
02:04.020 --> 02:05.063
‎Oh, right.

12
02:06.856 --> 02:07.982
‎I don't see any issues.

13
02:08.566 --> 02:09.901
‎What is it? What's wrong?

14
02:13.863 --> 02:15.240
‎What are you taking photos of?

15
02:24.540 --> 02:27.001
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

16
02:27.961 --> 02:30.171
‎EPISODE 5

17
02:31.256 --> 02:35.176
‎PHOTOS

18
02:40.223 --> 02:41.057
‎Dr. Gye.

19
02:41.975 --> 02:44.769
‎His vitals are stable and…

20
03:05.039 --> 03:07.834
‎Look at the time. ‎Why haven't you clocked out, Dr. Gye?

21
03:10.545 --> 03:11.963
‎Fill me in, will you?

22
03:15.717 --> 03:17.969
‎His family is waiting outside.

23
03:19.220 --> 03:20.054
‎You do it.

24
03:20.763 --> 03:22.265
‎Me? Do what?

25
03:22.348 --> 03:24.767
‎"The surgery went well, ‎and he's in recovery."

26
03:24.851 --> 03:25.935
‎"You can see him soon."

27
03:26.019 --> 03:27.645
‎Then what about this?

28
03:30.106 --> 03:31.065
‎What are you doing?

29
03:31.149 --> 03:33.901
‎Try taking it, ‎and I'll keep you out of my OR for good.

30
03:33.985 --> 03:35.319
‎But…

31
03:41.242 --> 03:42.577
‎Please don't get up.

32
03:44.495 --> 03:46.664
‎Mr. Kwon's surgery went well,

33
03:46.748 --> 03:48.291
‎and he's in recovery now.

34
03:49.125 --> 03:50.126
‎Thank you.

35
03:50.209 --> 03:51.544
‎Thank you so much.

36
03:51.627 --> 03:53.838
‎-Thank you. ‎-Oh, it wasn't me.

37
03:53.921 --> 03:55.131
‎She was the surgeon.

38
03:58.760 --> 03:59.802
‎Thank you.

39
04:06.184 --> 04:09.312
‎Thank you, Doctor.

40
04:30.708 --> 04:32.251
‎Asante.

41
04:42.720 --> 04:43.554
‎Come here.

42
04:46.391 --> 04:50.061
‎We'll monitor his progress for 30 minutes

43
04:50.144 --> 04:52.063
‎before taking him up to his room.

44
04:52.730 --> 04:55.733
‎-We'll update you again, so don't worry. ‎-Thank you.

45
04:55.817 --> 04:57.068
‎Aren't your feet cold?

46
04:57.151 --> 04:58.903
‎-Please sit. You must be exhausted. ‎-You're good?

47
05:12.542 --> 05:13.709
‎Asante.

48
05:18.506 --> 05:19.340
‎Are you sure?

49
05:19.424 --> 05:22.593
‎You're positive Mr. Kwon ‎hasn't had major surgery since Dr. Na?

50
05:22.677 --> 05:23.719
‎Yes.

51
05:23.803 --> 05:26.764
‎I'll need to look into it more, ‎but as far as I know, yes.

52
05:27.348 --> 05:28.349
‎Right…

53
05:29.642 --> 05:30.768
‎I see.

54
05:32.145 --> 05:33.563
‎They're initials, right?

55
05:33.646 --> 05:34.814
‎You see that too, right?

56
05:34.897 --> 05:36.691
‎-Did he brand-- ‎-Stop talking.

57
05:36.774 --> 05:38.651
‎You're making me picture how he did it.

58
05:41.279 --> 05:42.613
‎Should I send you the photos?

59
05:42.697 --> 05:43.865
‎What are you going to do?

60
05:43.948 --> 05:45.867
‎You'll tell Mr. Kwon tomorrow, right?

61
05:45.950 --> 05:47.160
‎Tell him?

62
05:47.243 --> 05:48.244
‎Why shouldn't she?

63
05:49.078 --> 05:50.872
‎Where are you going? This is serious.

64
05:51.372 --> 05:53.457
‎There's a team dinner at the agency, ‎so I have to go.

65
05:53.541 --> 05:54.584
‎Dinner? Are you serious?

66
05:54.667 --> 05:56.878
‎I need to get there ‎before the food runs out.

67
05:56.961 --> 05:58.754
‎-You're telling the hospital, right? ‎-No.

68
05:58.838 --> 06:00.298
‎You won't? Why not?

69
06:00.798 --> 06:02.675
‎The hospital hired that bastard. ‎Why bother?

70
06:02.758 --> 06:04.218
‎But the hospital didn't know.

71
06:04.302 --> 06:06.554
‎So we should tell them and the patient--

72
06:06.637 --> 06:07.805
‎Does he really have to know?

73
06:09.515 --> 06:10.641
‎Excuse me?

74
06:10.725 --> 06:11.726
‎Is that the right move?

75
06:13.978 --> 06:15.771
‎Dr. Jo, what do you mean?

76
06:15.855 --> 06:18.524
‎-Are you saying we should let this slide-- ‎-If we just stay quiet,

77
06:19.317 --> 06:23.613
‎Mr. Kwon can return to his life ‎with his loving family, just like before.

78
06:23.696 --> 06:24.530
‎The only difference

79
06:24.614 --> 06:27.533
‎would be the absence of his gallbladder.

80
06:27.617 --> 06:29.577
‎All we need to do is ‎advise him on his diet,

81
06:29.660 --> 06:31.704
‎tell him to exercise, ‎and cut down on drinking.

82
06:32.330 --> 06:33.247
‎Do you mean that?

83
06:33.331 --> 06:35.541
‎This whole thing is ‎confusing and horrific.

84
06:35.625 --> 06:36.667
‎I get it.

85
06:37.460 --> 06:39.545
‎But that's purely our perspective ‎after seeing that.

86
06:41.214 --> 06:42.089
‎Just once.

87
06:43.049 --> 06:44.175
‎Just once more.

88
06:45.218 --> 06:46.844
‎Let's think it over once more

89
06:47.929 --> 06:50.473
‎through the eyes of Mr. Kwon, ‎who hasn't seen it.

90
06:56.270 --> 06:57.730
‎Thank you for sharing ‎your interesting opinion.

91
06:58.356 --> 06:59.190
‎Once he finds out,

92
07:00.399 --> 07:01.609
‎there's no turning back.

93
07:05.655 --> 07:08.449
‎Patients have the right to know ‎what happened during surgery,

94
07:08.532 --> 07:11.702
‎and doctors have the responsibility ‎to inform them of what happened.

95
07:12.203 --> 07:13.037
‎I'll get going.

96
07:15.414 --> 07:16.290
‎Dr. Gye…

97
07:27.468 --> 07:29.262
‎If we do as you suggest,

98
07:29.345 --> 07:30.763
‎that patient

99
07:30.846 --> 07:34.934
‎will continue to treat the person ‎who did this to him as his savior.

100
07:35.643 --> 07:39.021
‎You want to let someone like that ‎keep operating

101
07:39.105 --> 07:40.856
‎and experimenting on more patients?

102
07:41.482 --> 07:44.193
‎Patients let us put them under ‎because they trust us as doctors.

103
07:44.277 --> 07:45.319
‎I know that.

104
07:45.403 --> 07:47.780
‎Today's surgery went well, and he's fine.

105
07:47.863 --> 07:49.991
‎Why should we inform him ‎about his past surgery?

106
07:50.074 --> 07:51.409
‎Because we saw it!

107
07:52.034 --> 07:52.868
‎Because we know.

108
07:53.744 --> 07:55.204
‎How could we ignore that?

109
07:55.288 --> 07:58.124
‎To call someone like that a doctor ‎after what he's done--

110
07:58.207 --> 07:59.041
‎Dr. Park!

111
08:01.335 --> 08:03.296
‎Are you protecting him as a fellow doctor?

112
08:05.840 --> 08:06.674
‎What?

113
08:09.885 --> 08:11.178
‎There's no turning back

114
08:12.513 --> 08:14.015
‎for us either.

115
08:15.933 --> 08:17.268
‎How could we continue

116
08:18.185 --> 08:19.770
‎to work with someone like him?

117
08:37.121 --> 08:38.247
‎Let's put your socks on.

118
08:38.331 --> 08:40.541
‎Here we go. Let's slide these on.

119
08:42.960 --> 08:44.211
‎How…

120
08:45.129 --> 08:46.797
‎How could we shatter that blissful peace?

121
08:48.007 --> 08:50.843
‎It's hell if you can't do anything ‎after finding out the truth.

122
08:52.553 --> 08:54.805
‎Especially when everything around you ‎feels like heaven.

123
08:56.057 --> 08:57.058
‎Dr. Kim.

124
08:58.851 --> 09:00.061
‎Dr. Kim?

125
09:00.144 --> 09:00.978
‎Dr. Kim.

126
09:01.062 --> 09:02.021
‎What?

127
09:02.647 --> 09:04.148
‎I'm coming.

128
09:04.231 --> 09:06.734
‎-Which bed needs a dressing change? ‎-Dr. Kim.

129
09:07.735 --> 09:09.362
‎Dr. Na, when did you get here?

130
09:11.155 --> 09:12.948
‎Are you coming from the OR?

131
09:13.032 --> 09:14.700
‎I said you didn't have to come.

132
09:14.784 --> 09:16.702
‎I guess you were right. No one was there.

133
09:16.786 --> 09:19.830
‎The surgery ended a while ago, ‎and she clocked out.

134
09:19.914 --> 09:23.334
‎I'm sorry. I should've gotten here sooner.

135
09:23.417 --> 09:24.418
‎No, not at all.

136
09:24.502 --> 09:26.087
‎It was absolute chaos here.

137
09:26.170 --> 09:28.798
‎I meant to explain clearly, ‎but there was a huge car accident.

138
09:28.881 --> 09:30.257
‎You must've hit terrible traffic.

139
09:30.341 --> 09:31.384
‎Yes.

140
09:31.467 --> 09:33.344
‎That's why I got here late.

141
09:33.427 --> 09:35.304
‎Traffic should be fine now, ‎so hurry and go home.

142
09:35.388 --> 09:37.723
‎Otherwise, you'll get pulled into surgery.

143
09:40.810 --> 09:43.479
‎Well, I'll scrub in ‎if anyone needs a hand.

144
09:44.605 --> 09:45.606
‎By the way…

145
09:47.316 --> 09:50.569
‎Did Dr. Gye say anything in particular?

146
09:51.153 --> 09:52.321
‎About what?

147
09:52.405 --> 09:55.866
‎About the surgery overall ‎or about Mr. Kwon's condition?

148
10:09.922 --> 10:12.550
‎I guess some adhesions formed ‎from the surgery you did

149
10:12.633 --> 10:14.051
‎during his service.

150
10:14.135 --> 10:15.302
‎It is what it is though.

151
10:15.845 --> 10:19.640
‎We were swamped, so Dr. Gye went in ‎with just Dr. Park and Dr. Jo.

152
10:20.141 --> 10:21.100
‎I heard it went well.

153
10:22.518 --> 10:23.644
‎I've been curious.

154
10:26.021 --> 10:26.939
‎What a shame.

155
10:34.280 --> 10:37.825
‎Goodness, my mouth is watering.

156
10:37.908 --> 10:39.577
‎Look at your face light up.

157
10:39.660 --> 10:40.619
‎Hey.

158
10:42.872 --> 10:44.248
‎-There. ‎-All right.

159
10:44.331 --> 10:45.416
‎Always in our prime.

160
10:45.499 --> 10:47.042
‎-Let's work hard. ‎-Let's work hard.

161
10:55.676 --> 10:58.304
‎Every now and then, ‎I crave food like this.

162
10:58.387 --> 11:00.097
‎Still, we should eat a proper meal.

163
11:00.181 --> 11:02.558
‎I can't tell if this is a team dinner ‎or a snack time.

164
11:02.641 --> 11:05.394
‎If you're so unhappy, ‎take on more individual patients.

165
11:05.478 --> 11:06.395
‎All right, genius?

166
11:06.896 --> 11:09.398
‎You're only getting by right now

167
11:09.482 --> 11:12.985
‎because you're doing acupuncture ‎for Mi-gyeong's patients.

168
11:13.068 --> 11:15.654
‎Why are people so slow ‎to believe in Korean medicine?

169
11:15.738 --> 11:17.656
‎I told you to go ‎to that Korean medicine clinic.

170
11:17.740 --> 11:19.325
‎They specialize in car accident cases,

171
11:19.408 --> 11:21.702
‎and business is so good ‎they need more staff.

172
11:21.785 --> 11:22.661
‎I'm not on board

173
11:23.370 --> 11:24.788
‎with their vision.

174
11:24.872 --> 11:26.916
‎What does vision matter ‎when you're saving lives?

175
11:26.999 --> 11:29.084
‎"What does vision matter ‎when you're making money?"

176
11:29.168 --> 11:30.336
‎That's what you mean.

177
11:32.213 --> 11:33.881
‎-I'm home. ‎-Take a seat.

178
11:33.964 --> 11:35.174
‎Hurry and sit down.

179
11:35.257 --> 11:38.177
‎I got your favorite pork organs and liver.

180
11:39.220 --> 11:40.971
‎There's ‎tteokbokki‎ too. Eat up.

181
11:42.806 --> 11:43.891
‎Hey, you…

182
11:44.517 --> 11:46.227
‎Gosh, you're fast.

183
11:46.810 --> 11:49.230
‎This place makes really good ‎sundae‎.

184
11:49.313 --> 11:51.815
‎Man, the liver is delicious.

185
11:51.899 --> 11:53.108
‎Your phone keeps buzzing.

186
11:56.529 --> 11:58.239
‎What if they need you for surgery? ‎Answer it.

187
12:05.871 --> 12:08.666
‎Dr. Gye, here are the photos just in case.

188
12:08.749 --> 12:09.792
‎I know they're unpleasant,

189
12:09.875 --> 12:12.503
‎but you should hold onto them ‎so you can show the patient tomorrow.

190
12:13.003 --> 12:14.838
‎Are you really ‎not ‎going ‎to ‎tell ‎the ‎hospital?

191
12:15.339 --> 12:17.341
‎I saw everything. I'll be your witness.

192
12:17.424 --> 12:20.094
‎Can I take your silence ‎as a sign you're considering it?

193
12:20.177 --> 12:23.180
‎It actually bothers you, right? ‎Right? ‎Right?

194
12:23.264 --> 12:26.141
‎If you don't feel like replying, ‎just send "Y" or "N."

195
12:26.767 --> 12:28.060
‎How do you block people?

196
12:36.652 --> 12:39.697
‎I'll never eat liver again.

197
12:39.780 --> 12:41.740
‎How can you be a doctor ‎and be so squeamish?

198
12:41.824 --> 12:45.077
‎A Korean medicine doctor rarely has to ‎deal with internal organs, okay?

199
12:45.160 --> 12:46.537
‎How the hell could he do that?

200
12:47.037 --> 12:47.871
‎This is good.

201
12:48.455 --> 12:51.709
‎-I wish the hospital served this. ‎-Goodness, Su-jeong…

202
12:52.209 --> 12:53.043
‎Right.

203
12:53.586 --> 12:55.129
‎You find everything delicious--

204
12:55.212 --> 12:56.297
‎What did I tell you?

205
12:56.380 --> 12:59.008
‎My hand reeked just from shaking his.

206
13:00.759 --> 13:05.014
‎Gosh, I'll need to save these photos ‎for my meeting with Director Bu.

207
13:07.725 --> 13:08.726
‎Give me the photos.

208
13:11.770 --> 13:12.646
‎Send them to me.

209
13:14.440 --> 13:16.859
‎Stop right there. Answer me.

210
13:16.942 --> 13:19.153
‎At least signal a "Y" to Ms. Jang.

211
13:19.236 --> 13:20.738
‎I think she's up to something.

212
13:20.821 --> 13:24.283
‎The ER is probably ‎too mundane for Su-jeong.

213
13:25.492 --> 13:26.535
‎That's true, but…

214
13:27.953 --> 13:29.246
‎Damn it, of all things…

215
13:52.061 --> 13:53.854
‎"Dae-il Na."

216
13:54.355 --> 13:55.481
‎"Dr. Na."

217
14:01.195 --> 14:03.322
‎It was definitely his first time.

218
14:03.906 --> 14:06.367
‎He couldn't get ‎the pressure control right,

219
14:06.909 --> 14:08.494
‎so the depth is inconsistent.

220
14:18.545 --> 14:19.880
‎LAW

221
14:23.759 --> 14:26.637
‎Let's finish up quickly.

222
14:26.720 --> 14:27.680
‎What time is it?

223
14:41.986 --> 14:43.320
‎We should sharpen our blades.

224
14:43.904 --> 14:46.782
‎Otherwise, the cuts ‎end up looking like scribbles.

225
14:46.865 --> 14:49.451
‎We're going to spread them ‎all over the place.

226
14:49.535 --> 14:53.122
‎The moment people see it, ‎it'll etch fear of us into their minds.

227
14:53.205 --> 14:56.667
‎We need to carve them like scribbles ‎to make it more chilling.

228
15:05.175 --> 15:07.803
‎A medical volunteer for the insurgents?

229
15:07.886 --> 15:11.140
‎Why not join us ‎as a Russian mercenary instead?

230
15:11.640 --> 15:13.642
‎If our commander doesn't pull through,

231
15:14.393 --> 15:15.477
‎we'll carve it into you too.

232
15:16.603 --> 15:20.441
‎And your colleagues ‎and the other insurgent bastards.

233
15:21.358 --> 15:23.527
‎She doesn't understand you.

234
15:23.610 --> 15:26.196
‎She hasn't said a word. Must be scared.

235
15:26.905 --> 15:28.574
‎At least she didn't piss her pants.

236
15:35.372 --> 15:37.374
‎Better keep your blade sharp.

237
15:38.042 --> 15:38.959
‎What?

238
15:40.002 --> 15:41.837
‎It's your turn next.

239
15:44.798 --> 15:47.259
‎How long do I have to keep waking you up?

240
15:47.342 --> 15:48.719
‎-What? ‎-You'd better wake up.

241
15:55.851 --> 15:57.728
‎Talk about perfect timing…

242
15:57.811 --> 15:58.645
‎Here.

243
16:00.105 --> 16:02.775
‎What did you mean by "it's your turn"?

244
16:02.858 --> 16:04.193
‎Jeez.

245
16:04.276 --> 16:06.528
‎If your dream was about that incident,

246
16:07.279 --> 16:08.655
‎just forget it.

247
16:26.090 --> 16:28.092
‎-Have you eaten? ‎-Yes, of course.

248
16:30.052 --> 16:32.930
‎Other doctors have received ‎positive feedback too,

249
16:33.013 --> 16:35.682
‎but Dr. Na has been ‎getting a lot these days.

250
16:36.391 --> 16:39.686
‎Of course, there are negative comments ‎about the hospital.

251
16:39.770 --> 16:41.980
‎But it's different with Dr. Na.

252
16:42.064 --> 16:44.191
‎He hasn't even been here long. ‎How amazing.

253
16:44.858 --> 16:47.361
‎Chairman Kim, you've got a keen eye.

254
16:48.112 --> 16:52.658
‎"I found so much comfort ‎in his kind explanation and warm support."

255
16:52.741 --> 16:54.243
‎It makes me wonder

256
16:54.326 --> 16:56.829
‎how badly the doctors ‎must've treated their patients until now.

257
16:56.912 --> 16:59.164
‎Oh, there you go again.

258
17:00.332 --> 17:04.294
‎Can't you just play along ‎and say we brought in a good doctor?

259
17:04.962 --> 17:08.549
‎By the way, the hospital looks run-down.

260
17:09.091 --> 17:10.884
‎It's the same as when I was here.

261
17:11.593 --> 17:15.430
‎Speaking of, sir, ‎about your medical welfare city project…

262
17:15.514 --> 17:17.015
‎Don't you have any snacks?

263
17:17.099 --> 17:19.143
‎All you're providing is a cup of coffee?

264
17:19.226 --> 17:20.060
‎Hey!

265
17:31.113 --> 17:33.615
‎You still owe me. ‎Keep this up, and I'll clean you out.

266
17:34.658 --> 17:35.826
‎I'll leave you the melon

267
17:35.909 --> 17:37.786
‎since you'll be calling me back soon.

268
17:39.288 --> 17:41.957
‎What are you doing with the fridge open?

269
17:48.297 --> 17:50.215
‎MOM, DAD

270
17:54.845 --> 17:57.764
‎Is this really my liver?

271
18:00.475 --> 18:04.563
‎Usually, cuts to the liver ‎heal within a week

272
18:04.646 --> 18:06.190
‎or just leave a faint mark.

273
18:07.941 --> 18:09.276
‎Then how is this…

274
18:10.444 --> 18:12.571
‎I haven't had surgery recently.

275
18:13.822 --> 18:16.533
‎The severe adhesions ‎and the overlying serosa

276
18:16.617 --> 18:18.869
‎actually protected it and kept it intact.

277
18:18.952 --> 18:20.829
‎It's a very rare case.

278
18:20.913 --> 18:22.414
‎I don't understand.

279
18:24.249 --> 18:25.083
‎So…

280
18:27.878 --> 18:29.713
‎Are you saying this was from…

281
18:32.633 --> 18:33.467
‎Baseball game.

282
18:34.134 --> 18:35.552
‎Premium channels are amazing.

283
18:38.096 --> 18:41.141
‎I know you find ‎these situations difficult,

284
18:41.808 --> 18:43.727
‎but putting on ‎a sports channel isn't right.

285
18:43.810 --> 18:44.728
‎DAD

286
18:44.811 --> 18:46.813
‎Are other channels okay then?

287
18:50.817 --> 18:51.735
‎Mr. Kwon,

288
18:52.527 --> 18:55.656
‎your last surgery was 15 years ago--

289
18:55.739 --> 18:57.282
‎Thank you for the great surgery.

290
18:58.408 --> 18:59.493
‎Thank you.

291
18:59.576 --> 19:01.620
‎I shouldn't have put it off, ‎even for work.

292
19:03.455 --> 19:05.749
‎I'm so grateful you were around, Dr. Gye.

293
19:06.667 --> 19:07.918
‎I'll make sure to repay you.

294
19:10.128 --> 19:13.382
‎It must've been so chaotic that night, ‎what with that car accident.

295
19:14.258 --> 19:16.510
‎But man, the pain was terrible.

296
19:18.011 --> 19:20.138
‎I should've had the surgery ‎when I first came in.

297
19:22.432 --> 19:24.851
‎Then Dr. Na would've operated on you.

298
19:26.270 --> 19:28.647
‎Aside from when Dr. Na operated on you,

299
19:28.730 --> 19:31.233
‎there's no record of you ‎ever going under general anesthesia.

300
19:33.652 --> 19:35.654
‎It was Dr. Na. He was the one who--

301
19:43.704 --> 19:44.997
‎Dad.

302
19:45.080 --> 19:46.832
‎Hey!

303
19:46.915 --> 19:48.208
‎Can you throw it to me?

304
19:49.334 --> 19:50.210
‎I got it.

305
19:50.294 --> 19:52.671
‎-It's yours now, Dad. ‎-Let's go outside and play.

306
19:53.964 --> 19:54.965
‎Here we go.

307
19:58.218 --> 20:01.847
‎It's important that you recover for now, ‎so get plenty of rest--

308
20:01.930 --> 20:04.016
‎We're having our second child next month.

309
20:06.518 --> 20:08.395
‎She can't wait to meet her sibling.

310
20:08.979 --> 20:11.148
‎She was born here, ‎and her sibling will be too.

311
20:11.231 --> 20:13.358
‎You won't face any negative consequences--

312
20:18.989 --> 20:20.615
‎Maybe it was the price for saving my life.

313
20:24.536 --> 20:25.370
‎Mr. Kwon.

314
20:28.457 --> 20:29.833
‎I'll put it behind me.

315
20:33.795 --> 20:35.589
‎-But-- ‎-Fine, if that's what you want.

316
20:38.842 --> 20:41.845
‎You said you're having ‎your second child here,

317
20:41.928 --> 20:43.430
‎but you live pretty far away.

318
20:44.306 --> 20:46.099
‎Yet you chose this hospital.

319
20:48.143 --> 20:49.144
‎It's for work, right?

320
20:55.817 --> 20:59.654
‎You must've seen countless people ‎lose all they had by going public.

321
21:00.155 --> 21:01.448
‎Dr. Gye.

322
21:06.870 --> 21:08.580
‎Just go back to your old life.

323
21:09.081 --> 21:10.248
‎You can do that.

324
21:11.249 --> 21:12.167
‎It's okay.

325
21:12.793 --> 21:14.419
‎No one will hold it against you.

326
21:25.097 --> 21:26.098
‎Close your eyes.

327
21:27.766 --> 21:30.143
‎Open your eyes and follow my finger.

328
21:34.689 --> 21:35.982
‎I'm good at playing dumb.

329
21:40.779 --> 21:45.200
‎That's how I made it this far ‎without a fancy degree or connections.

330
21:50.580 --> 21:51.623
‎ANESTHESIA RECORD ‎KWON CHUNG-HYEON

331
21:59.714 --> 22:01.049
‎And I'll keep being good at it.

332
22:09.015 --> 22:10.642
‎-Let's talk. ‎-No thanks.

333
22:10.725 --> 22:12.394
‎-Then I'll talk. ‎-No thanks.

334
22:12.978 --> 22:15.939
‎Go ahead and shut me out. I'm used to it.

335
22:16.022 --> 22:17.357
‎Just read this in return.

336
22:18.191 --> 22:19.901
‎Here, take a look.

337
22:19.985 --> 22:22.279
‎"Emergency Department ‎Violence Response Manual."

338
22:22.362 --> 22:24.656
‎It's a week from now, ‎so check the date and time

339
22:24.739 --> 22:25.615
‎and participate!

340
22:25.699 --> 22:27.075
‎I have surgery.

341
22:27.576 --> 22:28.827
‎I mean, take note of it.

342
22:28.910 --> 22:29.744
‎This is good.

343
22:31.037 --> 22:33.957
‎You know, ‎a thief broke into our break room.

344
22:34.040 --> 22:35.917
‎And not just any thief. A total pro.

345
22:36.001 --> 22:37.919
‎It was like finding our house cleaned out.

346
22:38.670 --> 22:40.380
‎No way. Seriously?

347
22:41.464 --> 22:42.507
‎So no more snacks?

348
22:42.591 --> 22:44.342
‎There's some left. It's in your hand.

349
22:45.802 --> 22:47.137
‎This is all that's left?

350
22:47.220 --> 22:48.388
‎That's right.

351
22:48.471 --> 22:50.515
‎The thief ate everything else, ‎so that's all there's left.

352
22:51.600 --> 22:52.434
‎Wow.

353
22:52.934 --> 22:53.977
‎Who could it be?

354
22:56.146 --> 22:57.230
‎Hey, my snack!

355
22:57.314 --> 22:59.024
‎-Hey now. ‎-My snack!

356
22:59.107 --> 23:01.526
‎Where are you going? ‎Handle your business upstairs.

357
23:01.610 --> 23:04.154
‎She's doing just fine here, ‎so stop coming downstairs!

358
23:05.363 --> 23:06.907
‎Don't forget to participate!

359
23:11.703 --> 23:13.288
‎Jeez, you're so fast.

360
23:14.831 --> 23:17.709
‎-How'd you write up Mr. Kwon's op report? ‎-I just wrote it.

361
23:17.792 --> 23:19.586
‎-I couldn't write mine. ‎-Just do your best.

362
23:20.253 --> 23:21.463
‎No.

363
23:22.172 --> 23:23.256
‎No.

364
23:25.967 --> 23:27.427
‎There weren't that many left.

365
23:30.096 --> 23:30.931
‎Good grief.

366
23:33.350 --> 23:34.601
‎I keep thinking about it.

367
23:36.561 --> 23:37.604
‎In that case…

368
23:39.439 --> 23:41.816
‎buy your own snacks. You have money.

369
23:41.900 --> 23:43.526
‎Don't change the subject.

370
23:44.653 --> 23:47.405
‎I thought I could do it, but I was wrong.

371
23:47.906 --> 23:50.116
‎Sure, I guess I can write it up ‎as if nothing happened.

372
23:50.200 --> 23:51.201
‎Then what's the problem?

373
23:51.284 --> 23:52.911
‎But I can't, that's what.

374
23:55.372 --> 23:56.414
‎If you can't write it,

375
23:57.582 --> 23:59.084
‎remember what you told me.

376
24:00.502 --> 24:02.754
‎-"Think it over through the eyes of--" ‎-What about you?

377
24:03.713 --> 24:04.714
‎Does it not bother you?

378
24:08.093 --> 24:08.969
‎I feel terrible.

379
24:10.345 --> 24:11.263
‎It feels like shit.

380
24:13.098 --> 24:14.224
‎Hey!

381
24:14.307 --> 24:16.268
‎Dr. Gye from the ER!

382
24:20.689 --> 24:21.606
‎You two are together often.

383
24:23.608 --> 24:24.651
‎Is surgery slow these days?

384
24:24.734 --> 24:25.944
‎No, we're busy.

385
24:26.861 --> 24:27.946
‎We were so busy

386
24:28.029 --> 24:30.657
‎that we unfortunately ‎weren't at the hospital that night.

387
24:30.740 --> 24:32.659
‎How did you know to be here?

388
24:32.742 --> 24:34.494
‎It's as if you knew ‎Mr. Kwon would come in.

389
24:35.078 --> 24:36.997
‎No, not "as if."

390
24:37.706 --> 24:38.540
‎I did know.

391
24:40.625 --> 24:41.793
‎We knew too.

392
24:41.876 --> 24:44.212
‎Of course he'd come. ‎Anyone would come at that point.

393
24:44.296 --> 24:47.173
‎Otherwise, he'd have needed ‎a much bigger operation.

394
24:47.257 --> 24:50.218
‎Wait, were you perhaps hoping for that?

395
24:50.302 --> 24:51.303
‎Are you serious?

396
24:51.845 --> 24:53.388
‎What's your problem?

397
24:54.931 --> 24:56.725
‎Where's the oldest of the trio?

398
24:56.808 --> 24:59.728
‎Oh, he went to see Mr. Kwon with Dr. Na…

399
25:01.938 --> 25:02.772
‎Together…

400
25:10.196 --> 25:11.614
‎You should just stay here.

401
25:11.698 --> 25:13.950
‎It's a two-person room, not just a single.

402
25:14.034 --> 25:15.201
‎A six-person room is too cramped.

403
25:15.285 --> 25:16.286
‎It's okay.

404
25:16.870 --> 25:19.205
‎I can't accept a favor like that.

405
25:19.289 --> 25:21.124
‎I couldn't even perform your surgery.

406
25:21.207 --> 25:23.335
‎No one else will be here for a while, ‎so just stay.

407
25:24.210 --> 25:25.045
‎No, it's okay.

408
25:25.712 --> 25:27.339
‎I'm grateful enough ‎that you came to see me.

409
25:27.922 --> 25:31.468
‎What pharma rep gets treated this well?

410
25:31.968 --> 25:35.680
‎Hey, we've been drinking buddies ‎for quite some time now.

411
25:35.764 --> 25:38.850
‎You need to get better soon ‎to work and to play golf again.

412
25:39.434 --> 25:40.393
‎I'll do that.

413
25:42.020 --> 25:45.482
‎Dr. Na was really disappointed ‎that he couldn't operate himself.

414
25:46.316 --> 25:47.609
‎He could've gotten…

415
25:48.485 --> 25:50.528
‎a certain sentimental bonus ‎for us surgeons.

416
25:51.071 --> 25:54.908
‎Seeing the liver he treated ‎right next to the gallbladder…

417
25:54.991 --> 25:56.034
‎Please stop.

418
25:57.035 --> 26:00.163
‎A-rin, let's help your dad get better. ‎Come blow on his sore spot.

419
26:00.246 --> 26:01.373
‎Just a second.

420
26:03.041 --> 26:04.250
‎Blow on it--

421
26:04.334 --> 26:06.086
‎Get away. He's my patient.

422
26:06.669 --> 26:08.380
‎No, you've got it wrong.

423
26:08.963 --> 26:10.757
‎I wasn't trying to do anything.

424
26:11.508 --> 26:12.425
‎Dr. Do.

425
26:12.509 --> 26:14.886
‎-Dr. Bae and Dr. Ma are looking for you. ‎-Huh?

426
26:15.470 --> 26:16.721
‎Dr. Do, we have a conference.

427
26:16.805 --> 26:18.681
‎Oh, right. Mr. Kwon, I'll come back.

428
26:19.265 --> 26:20.183
‎Let's go, Dr. Na.

429
26:21.142 --> 26:23.770
‎-Bye, A-rin. ‎-Bye.

430
26:53.133 --> 26:54.050
‎Are you angry?

431
26:55.468 --> 26:57.345
‎I can see why you'd misunderstand.

432
26:58.721 --> 26:59.556
‎I'm sorry.

433
27:01.474 --> 27:03.351
‎I do have to get to the conference,

434
27:04.185 --> 27:06.020
‎but when will you grab a meal with me?

435
27:06.104 --> 27:08.940
‎I haven't thanked you properly ‎for operating on Mr. Kwon,

436
27:09.482 --> 27:10.316
‎and…

437
27:13.319 --> 27:14.154
‎How did surgery go?

438
27:22.495 --> 27:25.081
‎Surgery is the only way ‎to get your attention, huh?

439
27:26.332 --> 27:28.001
‎I heard there were severe adhesions.

440
27:28.084 --> 27:30.253
‎I assume they were ‎from the surgery back then.

441
27:31.087 --> 27:31.963
‎Thank you for operating.

442
27:35.508 --> 27:37.760
‎So, how did the liver look?

443
27:47.687 --> 27:50.231
‎The finishing touches ‎were crude and sloppy.

444
27:51.232 --> 27:53.109
‎Like it was your first time.

445
27:55.320 --> 27:56.279
‎Was it that bad?

446
27:57.864 --> 28:00.492
‎I was in a rush and flustered ‎to do a good job back then.

447
28:01.284 --> 28:04.537
‎Still, it's not like he can see it.

448
28:04.621 --> 28:06.873
‎Or anyone else, for that matter.

449
28:07.499 --> 28:08.500
‎And it's not hurting him.

450
28:09.083 --> 28:10.919
‎He's alive, thanks to it.

451
28:11.002 --> 28:12.086
‎He got to build a family

452
28:12.670 --> 28:13.546
‎and a career as well.

453
28:15.006 --> 28:16.049
‎He's very lucky.

454
28:17.884 --> 28:21.012
‎But I can see how the surgery ‎I performed back then

455
28:21.095 --> 28:22.639
‎would look sloppy in your eyes,

456
28:23.223 --> 28:24.140
‎Dr. Gye.

457
28:25.350 --> 28:26.226
‎Actually,

458
28:27.268 --> 28:28.978
‎I'm really embarrassed right now, but…

459
28:31.189 --> 28:32.649
‎Will you really not eat with me?

460
28:36.236 --> 28:38.446
‎You shouldn't have said that.

461
28:39.405 --> 28:40.365
‎What do you mean?

462
28:43.785 --> 28:46.496
‎"He's alive, thanks to it."

463
28:47.872 --> 28:49.833
‎He's making me ask Ms. Jang for a favor.

464
28:54.671 --> 28:57.340
‎-I say she's ready to go home. ‎-Of course. Oh, the doctor's here.

465
28:57.423 --> 28:59.467
‎-Hello. ‎-Is she her surgeon?

466
28:59.551 --> 29:00.468
‎-Doctor. ‎-Yeah.

467
29:01.177 --> 29:02.428
‎Nice to meet you, Doctor.

468
29:03.471 --> 29:05.515
‎-Take this. ‎-You should open it for her.

469
29:05.598 --> 29:06.599
‎Oh, right.

470
29:07.392 --> 29:09.727
‎-Thank you so much. ‎-Yes, thank you.

471
29:11.229 --> 29:12.647
‎Dr. Gye really came through for her.

472
29:13.314 --> 29:16.234
‎Everyone said she was inoperable, ‎but Dr. Gye stepped up.

473
29:16.317 --> 29:17.485
‎I watched the surgery video.

474
29:18.403 --> 29:19.571
‎I was shocked.

475
29:20.446 --> 29:21.531
‎She was so fast.

476
29:23.449 --> 29:25.743
‎Do you know what Dr. Gye first said to me?

477
29:28.788 --> 29:29.831
‎What did she say?

478
29:32.917 --> 29:33.877
‎"Are you a doctor too?"

479
29:48.016 --> 29:50.226
‎-You're so pretty. ‎-Oh, here's another doctor.

480
29:50.810 --> 29:51.936
‎-Hello. ‎-How do you feel?

481
29:52.020 --> 29:53.479
‎Yes, thanks to you.

482
30:11.623 --> 30:12.707
‎I'm going to save you,

483
30:13.917 --> 30:14.834
‎no matter what.

484
30:15.877 --> 30:16.794
‎Thank you.

485
30:16.878 --> 30:18.588
‎-Sure. ‎-Say thank you to the doctor.

486
30:18.671 --> 30:20.465
‎She looks just like his wife.

487
30:20.548 --> 30:21.424
‎-She does. ‎-Yes.

488
30:21.507 --> 30:23.343
‎Thank goodness ‎she doesn't take after her dad.

489
30:23.426 --> 30:25.261
‎Come blow on his sore spot.

490
30:25.345 --> 30:26.346
‎Just a second.

491
30:27.221 --> 30:28.181
‎Blow on it.

492
31:26.489 --> 31:27.323
‎Outer pass.

493
31:34.706 --> 31:35.790
‎Houxi point.

494
31:51.681 --> 31:52.515
‎Darn it.

495
32:02.775 --> 32:04.110
‎And you couldn't do this earlier?

496
32:04.193 --> 32:05.778
‎I haven't seen that in a while.

497
32:06.612 --> 32:09.949
‎You've had a sip when the tremors go away, ‎thinking you're all fine, haven't you?

498
32:12.994 --> 32:14.245
‎Let's see how good you are.

499
32:14.328 --> 32:15.997
‎Look at this punk.

500
32:16.080 --> 32:17.457
‎I'm Jang Hui-suk.

501
32:18.374 --> 32:20.168
‎I'll show her how good I am.

502
32:21.544 --> 32:24.088
‎Hey, take this out. ‎I'm getting tremors again.

503
32:24.630 --> 32:25.548
‎You quack.

504
32:27.175 --> 32:29.761
‎Dr. Ma with the magnetic charm.

505
32:30.344 --> 32:32.388
‎Appendicitis doesn't even faze you now.

506
32:35.808 --> 32:38.603
‎Dr. Jo, did you just acknowledge me?

507
32:39.729 --> 32:41.481
‎I think she's zoning out.

508
32:44.317 --> 32:46.277
‎I'm just a bit tired.

509
32:47.028 --> 32:48.571
‎Busy schedule, right?

510
32:48.654 --> 32:49.489
‎Yes, I suppose.

511
32:50.364 --> 32:52.366
‎I hope we get more interns next year.

512
32:53.034 --> 32:54.327
‎Especially for general surgery.

513
32:55.161 --> 32:57.246
‎It's good that we have Dr. Na.

514
33:08.257 --> 33:09.759
‎You came yourself, Doctor?

515
33:12.178 --> 33:13.012
‎Where did they go?

516
33:15.264 --> 33:19.560
‎"We went to have dinner at the diner ‎where you collapsed. Kisses."

517
33:19.644 --> 33:20.686
‎And a heart.

518
33:21.437 --> 33:22.480
‎Let's take a look.

519
33:22.563 --> 33:23.397
‎Okay.

520
33:32.573 --> 33:34.075
‎What is it, Doctor?

521
33:34.784 --> 33:36.911
‎Is something wrong?

522
33:37.787 --> 33:38.704
‎Take a look.

523
33:52.635 --> 33:54.137
‎DAD

524
34:17.201 --> 34:19.120
‎DAD

525
34:24.167 --> 34:25.334
‎I drive kids around

526
34:26.586 --> 34:27.795
‎whose parents are doctors.

527
34:28.462 --> 34:31.132
‎Meanwhile, I don't even know ‎where my kid's daycare is.

528
34:38.514 --> 34:40.641
‎She knows how to write now.

529
34:44.937 --> 34:46.105
‎When did she grow up so fast?

530
34:49.901 --> 34:51.402
‎Why did you show me that photo?

531
34:51.485 --> 34:53.362
‎There's nothing I can do about it.

532
34:54.113 --> 34:56.532
‎It's not life-threatening ‎or visible from the outside.

533
34:57.408 --> 34:59.160
‎No one would've known ‎if you hadn't said anything.

534
35:03.080 --> 35:05.583
‎The person who branded you ‎would've had the same thought.

535
35:07.585 --> 35:08.419
‎Dr. Gye.

536
35:09.879 --> 35:10.713
‎To be honest…

537
35:13.216 --> 35:14.175
‎I can see it.

538
35:16.219 --> 35:17.345
‎I can see it clearly.

539
35:19.138 --> 35:20.056
‎I see how…

540
35:22.183 --> 35:24.894
‎my body was treated like a toy.

541
35:24.977 --> 35:26.062
‎And today…

542
35:28.105 --> 35:30.358
‎it felt like he could see it too.

543
35:32.109 --> 35:33.945
‎And it's driving me insane.

544
35:36.906 --> 35:41.202
‎I'm sure that's what ‎the bastard wanted the most.

545
35:53.547 --> 35:54.590
‎JANG HUI-SUK

546
35:54.674 --> 35:56.050
‎I'm taking it out of your pay.

547
35:56.717 --> 35:57.635
‎Every last penny.

548
35:57.718 --> 35:58.970
‎NA DAE-IL HEALTH SCREENING RESULTS

549
36:02.974 --> 36:04.475
‎HEALTH SCREENING REPORT

550
36:08.521 --> 36:10.815
‎Oh, right. Dr. Na took some time off.

551
36:11.482 --> 36:13.192
‎But he just got here.

552
36:13.276 --> 36:15.236
‎He did a health checkup when he got hired,

553
36:15.319 --> 36:16.988
‎and they found something in his liver.

554
36:17.071 --> 36:20.700
‎If it's a biopsy, ‎it'll be done laparoscopically, right?

555
36:21.492 --> 36:24.036
‎He's gone for a while, ‎so I'm guessing it's open surgery.

556
36:25.121 --> 36:26.080
‎Who's operating?

557
36:29.917 --> 36:30.835
‎Channel 32.

558
36:31.752 --> 36:33.838
‎It's the premium sports channel.

559
36:43.848 --> 36:46.017
‎Better keep your blade sharp.

560
36:46.100 --> 36:47.685
‎It's your turn next.

561
36:51.147 --> 36:54.066
‎TEN DAYS LATER

562
36:55.443 --> 36:58.237
‎Just as I thought. ‎You came out of anesthesia quickly.

563
36:58.321 --> 37:00.448
‎The surgery went well.

564
37:00.531 --> 37:01.449
‎Thank you.

565
37:02.366 --> 37:03.200
‎What?

566
37:04.118 --> 37:05.494
‎I said thank you.

567
37:06.078 --> 37:07.621
‎No need. It wasn't difficult.

568
37:09.081 --> 37:10.041
‎Things should be fine.

569
37:10.833 --> 37:11.667
‎Get some rest.

570
37:18.507 --> 37:22.261
‎I can't believe it was right between ‎the hepatic vein and IVC.

571
37:23.846 --> 37:25.681
‎Eat up. The hospital food here is good.

572
37:25.765 --> 37:26.599
‎Okay.

573
37:27.099 --> 37:28.934
‎You'll need to move around.

574
37:29.018 --> 37:32.730
‎I was already planning on ‎taking a walk to the radiology file room.

575
37:32.813 --> 37:34.523
‎You want to watch your surgery?

576
37:35.191 --> 37:37.151
‎I know it was just an excisional biopsy,

577
37:37.985 --> 37:39.195
‎but I'm curious.

578
37:39.278 --> 37:40.279
‎What the heck?

579
37:40.363 --> 37:42.365
‎Are you a scholar or a weirdo?

580
37:43.449 --> 37:44.533
‎Just curious, that's all.

581
37:44.617 --> 37:46.285
‎He should be able to, right?

582
37:47.787 --> 37:48.829
‎Dr. Na can, for sure.

583
37:50.289 --> 37:51.332
‎What do you mean?

584
37:51.415 --> 37:55.419
‎You know how we were totally against ‎having CCTVs in the OR?

585
37:56.045 --> 37:59.006
‎The CCTV mandate ended up getting passed…

586
37:59.090 --> 38:01.300
‎Why make it in the first place?

587
38:01.384 --> 38:02.676
‎We're not criminals or anything.

588
38:02.760 --> 38:05.805
‎But we managed to ‎tweak the language in the bill

589
38:05.888 --> 38:07.973
‎so that you can't really ‎watch the whole thing.

590
38:08.057 --> 38:11.936
‎You might not have known ‎because you were a military doctor.

591
38:13.521 --> 38:15.314
‎-So I can't watch it? ‎-Well…

592
38:15.398 --> 38:18.150
‎You can only watch it if everyone ‎who was in the OR gives consent,

593
38:18.234 --> 38:21.529
‎including the PA, anesthesiologist, ‎primary surgeon, and so on.

594
38:21.612 --> 38:25.616
‎So it's basically impossible ‎for the patient to see it.

595
38:26.700 --> 38:29.662
‎But you should have no problem ‎getting Dr. Mun's consent.

596
38:29.745 --> 38:30.621
‎Right.

597
38:32.206 --> 38:34.917
‎So this is what it's like to be a patient.

598
38:35.000 --> 38:36.710
‎You're not a patient, Dr. Na.

599
38:36.794 --> 38:39.255
‎A doctor is still a doctor ‎even if they're sick.

600
38:39.338 --> 38:40.172
‎You think so?

601
38:41.173 --> 38:42.466
‎What do you want, Gye-snake?

602
38:42.550 --> 38:43.634
‎Why are you here?

603
38:43.717 --> 38:45.052
‎I'm okay with her being here.

604
38:59.608 --> 39:00.484
‎What's with them?

605
39:02.778 --> 39:03.988
‎Are they a thing now?

606
39:15.124 --> 39:16.125
‎Seriously?

607
39:19.128 --> 39:19.962
‎Careful.

608
39:21.130 --> 39:23.674
‎The thing is… I kind of…

609
39:24.592 --> 39:26.177
‎How should I say this?

610
39:26.260 --> 39:28.095
‎Why won't you give consent?

611
39:28.179 --> 39:29.346
‎It's unfair to others

612
39:29.430 --> 39:32.349
‎if I give consent ‎just because you're a doctor…

613
39:32.433 --> 39:34.560
‎Dr. Mun, it's me we're talking about.

614
39:35.519 --> 39:36.520
‎Unfair to others?

615
39:38.147 --> 39:39.190
‎I'm disappointed in you.

616
39:39.273 --> 39:40.191
‎Hey.

617
39:41.233 --> 39:43.569
‎You shouldn't take that tone with me.

618
39:43.652 --> 39:46.572
‎It's not like you died ‎or a complication happened.

619
39:46.655 --> 39:48.240
‎Did something happen during surgery?

620
39:49.241 --> 39:51.494
‎I told you nothing happened.

621
39:51.577 --> 39:52.870
‎It wasn't even a big deal.

622
39:52.953 --> 39:55.372
‎Then why won't you say yes? Just tell me.

623
39:57.291 --> 39:59.293
‎-I've done a lot for you-- ‎-Look.

624
40:01.754 --> 40:03.797
‎I went for a round of golf before surgery.

625
40:04.423 --> 40:05.257
‎And I…

626
40:06.842 --> 40:07.968
‎won, all right?

627
40:08.052 --> 40:08.886
‎So…

628
40:08.969 --> 40:10.137
‎Who did you play with?

629
40:10.763 --> 40:12.640
‎You know, the drug rep.

630
40:13.432 --> 40:14.308
‎He got discharged.

631
40:15.184 --> 40:17.686
‎To celebrate, ‎he's treating us all, a few at a time.

632
40:18.854 --> 40:19.855
‎So?

633
40:20.940 --> 40:22.024
‎So I had a drink.

634
40:22.858 --> 40:23.859
‎And then another one.

635
40:24.610 --> 40:26.278
‎-So… ‎-And then another one.

636
40:29.114 --> 40:30.241
‎You didn't operate?

637
40:32.284 --> 40:33.452
‎That can't be.

638
40:34.161 --> 40:35.120
‎Are you insane?

639
40:35.996 --> 40:38.082
‎Do we need to breathalyze you ‎before surgery now?

640
40:38.165 --> 40:40.751
‎Who the hell do you think you are?

641
40:40.834 --> 40:43.337
‎You're not my anesthesiologist, are you?

642
40:43.420 --> 40:45.047
‎You think you're coming into my OR?

643
40:45.881 --> 40:46.799
‎No, you're not.

644
40:46.882 --> 40:49.468
‎It's my OR. Mind your own damn business!

645
40:49.552 --> 40:51.387
‎-Arrogant punk. Out of my way. ‎-No.

646
40:52.179 --> 40:53.305
‎Not in your condition.

647
40:53.389 --> 40:54.932
‎I ought to just…

648
40:55.015 --> 40:58.477
‎Fine, let's all get contaminated.

649
40:58.978 --> 41:00.145
‎Hit me.

650
41:00.229 --> 41:01.397
‎I said hit me!

651
41:01.480 --> 41:02.731
‎Have you lost your minds?

652
41:04.817 --> 41:06.110
‎What the hell are you doing?

653
41:06.694 --> 41:07.653
‎I'm sorry.

654
41:08.862 --> 41:11.574
‎Look, this crazy…

655
41:11.657 --> 41:12.658
‎I warned you

656
41:12.741 --> 41:16.453
‎that showing up to the OR drunk again ‎would mean disciplinary action.

657
41:18.205 --> 41:20.791
‎If that's the case, ‎you won't find any surgeons--

658
41:20.874 --> 41:22.126
‎There are plenty.

659
41:22.793 --> 41:24.670
‎Not everyone is trash like you.

660
41:25.754 --> 41:28.716
‎Word is you grab the assistants' asses, ‎pretending to wipe blood.

661
41:28.799 --> 41:30.843
‎Call it a superstition, ‎but it's my surgery ritual.

662
41:30.926 --> 41:32.219
‎Skip it, and I invite bad luck.

663
41:32.303 --> 41:33.971
‎Bad luck? Superstition?

664
41:34.722 --> 41:35.931
‎What kind of doctor says that?

665
41:36.015 --> 41:37.057
‎Enough!

666
41:37.766 --> 41:40.978
‎Dr. Jo, if you want to act righteous,

667
41:41.061 --> 41:43.397
‎get people together ‎and file a formal complaint,

668
41:43.480 --> 41:44.982
‎not make a scene.

669
41:45.941 --> 41:47.359
‎Get back to the OR right now.

670
41:53.699 --> 41:57.244
‎It's always the ones who don't know ‎the pressure of holding a scalpel.

671
41:58.621 --> 42:00.789
‎The lives of thousands of people

672
42:00.873 --> 42:03.876
‎are in these hands.

673
42:03.959 --> 42:06.587
‎You'd better shut the hell up.

674
42:06.670 --> 42:07.504
‎What?

675
42:09.256 --> 42:10.090
‎Shut up?

676
42:10.674 --> 42:12.926
‎Pressure of holding a scalpel? ‎Surgery ritual?

677
42:14.428 --> 42:15.387
‎Mun Yeong-jong.

678
42:17.097 --> 42:19.808
‎I was a surgeon for over half my life.

679
42:19.892 --> 42:23.228
‎I'm not some washed-up hack ‎you can ignore.

680
42:30.486 --> 42:31.820
‎Call a disciplinary hearing.

681
42:31.904 --> 42:32.863
‎Fine. Go ahead.

682
42:33.697 --> 42:34.823
‎Call a hearing.

683
42:37.826 --> 42:38.744
‎Remind me,

684
42:39.828 --> 42:42.081
‎-how many surgeries do I have today? ‎-One more thing.

685
42:42.164 --> 42:44.124
‎Which general surgeon ‎is available right now?

686
42:47.294 --> 42:48.462
‎Okay.

687
42:48.545 --> 42:49.755
‎Send them to OR 4 right now.

688
42:53.258 --> 42:54.093
‎So?

689
42:59.431 --> 43:01.517
‎-So… ‎-So?

690
43:04.603 --> 43:05.688
‎Who operated on me?

691
43:19.743 --> 43:20.703
‎Dr. Gye Su-jeong.

692
43:21.620 --> 43:23.789
‎Let's begin the surgery.

693
43:28.127 --> 43:30.087
‎I'll give you my consent ‎to watch the CCTV video,

694
43:30.170 --> 43:31.880
‎since my name is on your case.

695
43:33.215 --> 43:36.218
‎I have Magnolia running interference ‎on the disciplinary hearing.

696
43:36.301 --> 43:38.178
‎So you should just let this go too.

697
43:55.529 --> 43:56.363
‎Excuse me.

698
43:57.448 --> 43:59.116
‎What's going on here?

699
43:59.742 --> 44:03.245
‎That was the same day ‎as the ER violence response protocol,

700
44:03.328 --> 44:05.456
‎so the siren went off.

701
44:05.539 --> 44:07.124
‎I think they were just startled.

702
44:08.041 --> 44:10.335
‎Can you zoom in on this?

703
44:11.378 --> 44:13.464
‎No, of course not. ‎They made it that way.

704
44:13.547 --> 44:16.258
‎-They made it that way? ‎-Yes, the other doctors

705
44:16.341 --> 44:18.927
‎had the camera installed ‎as far away as possible

706
44:19.011 --> 44:21.221
‎and made it impossible to zoom in.

707
44:27.853 --> 44:28.771
‎Damn it.

708
44:30.105 --> 44:31.398
‎Sons of bitches.

709
45:01.595 --> 45:03.055
‎They have good fried chicken.

710
45:06.183 --> 45:08.227
‎So this is where Su-jeong works.

711
45:08.727 --> 45:09.561
‎She's come a long way.

712
45:10.187 --> 45:11.688
‎I'm so proud of her.

713
45:11.772 --> 45:13.774
‎I thought she was a lost cause.

714
45:16.109 --> 45:17.110
‎Hello, Doctor.

715
45:17.194 --> 45:18.946
‎-Yes? ‎-Is Dr. Gye here?

716
45:20.072 --> 45:22.032
‎Oh, you must be the agency director ‎who lives with her.

717
45:22.115 --> 45:25.369
‎Goodness, I guess Dr. Gye ‎has talked about me a lot.

718
45:25.452 --> 45:26.995
‎Not Dr. Gye.

719
45:27.079 --> 45:28.038
‎This one right here.

720
45:29.331 --> 45:30.791
‎-Hello, Dr. Park. ‎-Hello.

721
45:31.500 --> 45:34.253
‎Am I invited too? Are you sure it's okay?

722
45:34.336 --> 45:35.546
‎Of course.

723
45:35.629 --> 45:38.840
‎We can easily fit two guests ‎at our agency dinner.

724
45:38.924 --> 45:41.468
‎Oh, really? ‎By two dinner guests, do you mean…

725
45:41.552 --> 45:43.011
‎-Am I the other-- ‎-Hello.

726
45:44.763 --> 45:45.681
‎I'm Jo Won-jin.

727
45:46.515 --> 45:48.517
‎Ms. Jang, you don't have to invite me.

728
45:48.600 --> 45:49.935
‎I guess it wasn't me.

729
45:50.936 --> 45:53.605
‎It's nothing fancy. ‎Just some fried chicken and beer.

730
45:54.606 --> 45:57.234
‎I wanted to repay you ‎for being so kind to Dr. Gye.

731
45:58.026 --> 46:00.070
‎By the way, is she busy? ‎I haven't seen her yet.

732
46:00.153 --> 46:02.906
‎I think she was treating ‎a burn patient over there…

733
46:04.366 --> 46:05.742
‎Isn't that Dr. Na?

734
46:06.618 --> 46:07.661
‎What's wrong with him?

735
46:07.744 --> 46:09.746
‎What a great day for our work dinner.

736
46:11.748 --> 46:14.042
‎Dr. Na, what are you doing? ‎We're in the ER--

737
46:14.126 --> 46:15.168
‎Where's Gye Su-jeong?

738
46:15.961 --> 46:17.004
‎Did you speak informally to me?

739
46:17.087 --> 46:19.631
‎Where's your damn tutor?

740
46:19.715 --> 46:21.258
‎I never taught him anything.

741
46:23.302 --> 46:26.513
‎No matter how good my sutures are, ‎you still need to rest.

742
46:26.597 --> 46:27.556
‎What are you--

743
46:31.059 --> 46:32.519
‎Keep this up, and we'll see your organs.

744
46:38.984 --> 46:40.193
‎What did you do to me?

745
46:42.279 --> 46:44.072
‎Something that isn't hurting you

746
46:44.156 --> 46:46.116
‎and isn't visible to others

747
46:46.199 --> 46:49.411
‎or to you, for that matter.

748
46:56.877 --> 46:57.753
‎Don't tell me

749
46:58.587 --> 46:59.504
‎you did ‎that?

750
47:00.881 --> 47:02.633
‎It'll fade away in a week anyway.

751
47:04.092 --> 47:04.968
‎What?

752
47:05.469 --> 47:08.305
‎Don't expect the same miracle ‎of it staying with you

753
47:08.388 --> 47:10.140
‎for the next ten years.

754
47:12.851 --> 47:13.852
‎Oh, right.

755
47:15.187 --> 47:16.396
‎Do you really think…

756
47:19.983 --> 47:21.026
‎I only branded you

757
47:22.110 --> 47:23.695
‎with my initials?

758
47:31.036 --> 47:31.870
‎Gye Su-jeong, you…

759
47:49.429 --> 47:50.806
‎-Gye Su-jeong. ‎-Stop!

760
47:53.350 --> 47:54.226
‎Hello?

761
47:54.810 --> 47:57.187
‎This is the GUMC emergency room. ‎Please hurry.

762
48:03.777 --> 48:04.986
‎Dr. Gye!

763
48:11.118 --> 48:11.952
‎Su-jeong…

764
48:13.620 --> 48:14.788
‎Dr. Gye.

765
48:16.373 --> 48:17.749
‎Dr. Gye, you're bleeding.

766
48:17.833 --> 48:19.584
‎We need to stop it. You have surgery--

767
48:19.668 --> 48:21.128
‎Be quiet. It's not like he cut my hand.

768
48:21.211 --> 48:22.421
‎Is that so?

769
48:23.839 --> 48:25.006
‎Then your hand is next.

770
48:26.591 --> 48:27.884
‎Hey!

771
48:29.761 --> 48:31.763
‎You just messed with

772
48:31.847 --> 48:35.016
‎our agency's biggest cash cow!

773
48:35.100 --> 48:37.477
‎Don't, Ms. Jang. ‎The police will be here soon.

774
48:37.561 --> 48:40.522
‎She's the one paying all our bills!

775
48:40.605 --> 48:42.733
‎In fact, she's the one ‎paying for dinner today!

776
48:43.692 --> 48:44.526
‎I am?

777
48:45.819 --> 48:49.072
‎That's it. You're going down today.

778
48:49.156 --> 48:51.366
‎What the hell are you saying?

779
49:43.460 --> 49:44.753
‎Don't move.

780
49:45.337 --> 49:46.797
‎That stung, didn't it?

781
49:47.881 --> 49:50.801
‎You think I only saved people ‎back in North Korea?

782
49:52.594 --> 49:54.763
‎You think I didn't do whatever it took

783
49:54.846 --> 49:56.181
‎to feed my family?

784
49:56.932 --> 49:58.809
‎No one will know

785
49:58.892 --> 50:00.769
‎-Are you okay? ‎-what made you this way.

786
50:00.852 --> 50:02.479
‎-Why did you do that? ‎-So?

787
50:02.562 --> 50:03.939
‎Want to keep this up?

788
50:10.070 --> 50:11.446
‎You're screwed.

789
50:14.407 --> 50:15.700
‎We won't take that patient…

790
50:15.784 --> 50:17.369
‎I mean, we won't take that bastard.

791
50:17.452 --> 50:21.373
‎I never turn away patients, ‎but he needs to be transferred.

792
50:21.957 --> 50:23.542
‎-What kind of doctor… ‎-Are you okay?

793
50:23.625 --> 50:26.795
‎How could Dr. Na do something so absurd?

794
50:28.505 --> 50:29.923
‎Dr. Gye, you're still bleeding.

795
50:35.262 --> 50:36.388
‎Dr. Park, are you okay?

796
50:37.305 --> 50:38.390
‎You planned this, didn't you?

797
50:39.140 --> 50:41.351
‎Is this about the ketchup ‎on the omelet rice?

798
50:41.434 --> 50:42.811
‎What's going on?

799
50:42.894 --> 50:45.272
‎-I guess no one knew. ‎-She whispered something to him.

800
50:54.531 --> 50:55.657
‎Gye Su-jeong!

801
50:56.575 --> 50:58.243
‎Hey, Gye's injured.

802
50:58.326 --> 51:00.245
‎-What? ‎-She injured her arm.

803
51:00.328 --> 51:01.162
‎She's bleeding.

804
51:02.414 --> 51:04.249
‎-She's bleeding. ‎-The cut is wide open.

805
51:04.332 --> 51:07.294
‎Dr. Gye causes trouble ‎no matter what floor she's on.

806
51:08.545 --> 51:09.588
‎I think it's time…

807
51:11.131 --> 51:13.425
‎to terminate the contract.

808
51:15.552 --> 51:16.553
‎Check your phone.

809
51:17.220 --> 51:19.139
‎I told you I'd clean you out.

810
51:24.185 --> 51:25.687
‎Well, it's time for me to collect.

811
51:33.570 --> 51:34.946
‎It's just a surface wound.

812
51:35.530 --> 51:36.740
‎Right, it's simple.

813
51:37.282 --> 51:39.910
‎-Just some sutures. ‎-Then who's going to…

814
51:40.535 --> 51:42.829
‎Obviously, this is a case

815
51:42.913 --> 51:47.125
‎For emergency medicine

816
51:47.208 --> 51:48.752
‎Why are you all excited?

817
51:48.835 --> 51:49.753
‎That's not fair.

818
51:50.337 --> 51:53.173
‎I want a turn at suturing Gye's arm too.

819
51:55.008 --> 51:57.385
‎What? After what she put me through,

820
51:57.469 --> 52:01.389
‎I just want to stitch her up ‎so that it hurts a little bit.

821
52:01.473 --> 52:03.350
‎So I wasn't the only one thinking that.

822
52:03.433 --> 52:05.644
‎I want to stitch up her arm too--

823
52:05.727 --> 52:07.729
‎That's pretty mean, don't you think?

824
52:07.812 --> 52:11.191
‎Dr. Gye isn't made of steel. ‎She's an ordinary person.

825
52:11.274 --> 52:13.526
‎She got injured because of me. ‎I feel so terrible.

826
52:13.610 --> 52:14.986
‎Rock, paper, scissors it is.

827
52:15.070 --> 52:16.029
‎-Go! ‎-Enough.

828
52:17.948 --> 52:18.782
‎I want…

829
52:28.375 --> 52:29.542
‎you to do it.

830
52:30.585 --> 52:32.003
‎Me?

831
52:32.087 --> 52:34.589
‎Dr. Gye, that's a huge risk.

832
52:34.673 --> 52:36.424
‎Are you sure about this?

833
52:36.508 --> 52:38.677
‎I'm actually saying this out of concern.

834
52:38.760 --> 52:41.179
‎You might end up with a worse scar, and--

835
52:41.262 --> 52:42.430
‎If that happens, I'll do it.

836
52:42.514 --> 52:43.390
‎-Hey! ‎-Hey!

837
52:44.307 --> 52:47.435
‎-Then… ‎-Rock, paper, scissors!

838
52:47.519 --> 52:49.020
‎-Rock, paper, scissors. ‎-Darn it.

839
52:49.104 --> 52:50.146
‎Everyone, get out!

840
53:09.582 --> 53:12.502
‎Dr. Gye, are you okay?

841
53:12.585 --> 53:14.963
‎I'll be okay if you shut your mouth.

842
53:25.598 --> 53:27.767
‎It's okay. ‎Getting started is half the battle.

843
53:29.853 --> 53:32.856
‎I'm sure some other department ‎will take care of the rest.

844
53:33.648 --> 53:35.525
‎You're taking him next, right, buddy?

845
53:35.608 --> 53:37.318
‎Come on, he's making me so nervous.

846
53:37.402 --> 53:39.446
‎What the hell did you do to her arm?

847
53:40.447 --> 53:42.824
‎Look, young doctor. ‎It's not too late for you

848
53:42.907 --> 53:45.285
‎-to get into Korean medicine… ‎-Come along.

849
53:45.952 --> 53:48.371
‎-Come on, he has that vibe. ‎-Let's go.

850
54:04.345 --> 54:05.430
‎Oh jeez!

851
54:07.724 --> 54:08.725
‎SURGERY PERSONNEL CHANGES

852
54:08.808 --> 54:12.437
‎"Na Dae-il. ‎Suspension of duties and dismissal."

853
54:12.520 --> 54:16.316
‎Why on earth did Dr. Na do that?

854
54:16.399 --> 54:18.026
‎I hear he's going to be arrested.

855
54:18.109 --> 54:18.943
‎Really?

856
54:19.027 --> 54:20.236
‎Man…

857
54:22.864 --> 54:24.115
‎Hey!

858
54:24.741 --> 54:26.117
‎Mr. Kwon!

859
54:27.494 --> 54:30.330
‎-Welcome. Thank you. ‎-Here you go.

860
54:30.413 --> 54:31.498
‎How are you feeling?

861
54:31.581 --> 54:34.250
‎Sorry I didn't check on you. ‎Something big came up here.

862
54:34.751 --> 54:36.336
‎Thanks to everyone,

863
54:36.419 --> 54:38.213
‎I'm feeling much better.

864
54:39.172 --> 54:41.591
‎We got the new product information ‎you sent over.

865
54:41.674 --> 54:43.718
‎-Shall we move to the conference room? ‎-Actually…

866
54:44.844 --> 54:46.596
‎You heard about Dr. Na, right?

867
54:47.305 --> 54:48.640
‎Why did he do that?

868
54:48.723 --> 54:50.266
‎I figured you might know.

869
54:51.351 --> 54:52.519
‎Really?

870
54:52.602 --> 54:53.686
‎I wouldn't know.

871
54:54.813 --> 54:56.272
‎I was really baffled too.

872
54:56.898 --> 54:58.191
‎Is that so?

873
55:19.045 --> 55:20.839
‎After the surgery, ‎did you notice anything…

874
55:20.922 --> 55:22.257
‎Hello!

875
55:25.885 --> 55:28.179
‎Hey, why are you wiping that desk?

876
55:35.812 --> 55:37.605
‎I'll be right back!

877
55:37.689 --> 55:38.606
‎What…

878
55:39.107 --> 55:40.275
‎What did he leave behind?

879
55:42.902 --> 55:43.778
‎Dr. Do.

880
55:46.948 --> 55:47.907
‎You should see this.

881
55:57.750 --> 56:00.920
‎APPOINTMENT ‎GENERAL SURGERY LOCUM, DR. GYE SU-JEONG

882
56:04.883 --> 56:05.925
‎Dr. Gye!

883
56:06.009 --> 56:07.677
‎Here! This is yours.

884
56:08.678 --> 56:11.222
‎They just got this ready, ‎so I picked it up for you.

885
56:12.682 --> 56:13.808
‎Come on, try it on.

886
56:18.771 --> 56:19.606
‎I'll take that.

887
56:31.117 --> 56:33.203
‎This is the story of a lone wolf.

888
56:35.121 --> 56:38.458
‎I didn't expect the esteemed director ‎to come and visit me.

889
56:39.542 --> 56:41.961
‎You filed lawsuits for aggravated assault

890
56:42.045 --> 56:43.796
‎and for causing a disturbance.

891
56:44.380 --> 56:45.715
‎So I figured I was done seeing you.

892
56:45.798 --> 56:48.843
‎Ms. Jang sent me a photo

893
56:48.927 --> 56:50.511
‎to cut a deal.

894
56:50.595 --> 56:51.763
‎Thanks to you,

895
56:52.347 --> 56:55.141
‎Dr. Gye has been reassigned ‎to general surgery.

896
56:56.434 --> 57:01.773
‎A solitary figure that has emerged ‎in the era of mafia in white,

897
57:01.856 --> 57:05.235
‎where even the practice of saving lives ‎is driven by money and power.

898
57:07.487 --> 57:08.988
‎She belongs to no group.

899
57:11.449 --> 57:14.035
‎Are you here to ask why I did it?

900
57:14.619 --> 57:15.495
‎No.

901
57:15.578 --> 57:17.997
‎I don't care about that at all.

902
57:18.581 --> 57:22.919
‎I was just quite surprised

903
57:23.002 --> 57:25.630
‎at how it managed to stay

904
57:26.381 --> 57:27.757
‎completely intact.

905
57:28.800 --> 57:31.719
‎The human body is fascinating, isn't it?

906
57:32.470 --> 57:36.182
‎You can't rest or let your guard down.

907
57:37.100 --> 57:38.560
‎I was reminded again

908
57:38.643 --> 57:43.189
‎that being a doctor means ‎learning through your patients' bodies…

909
57:45.149 --> 57:47.402
‎not finding amusement in them.

910
57:51.781 --> 57:55.034
‎You think I don't know Kwon Chung-hyeon ‎is keeping it under wraps?

911
57:56.244 --> 57:57.704
‎I'm a first-time offender

912
57:57.787 --> 58:00.081
‎with diminished capacity due to stress.

913
58:00.665 --> 58:01.541
‎And I'm a doctor.

914
58:02.292 --> 58:06.004
‎A military doctor who served his country ‎for almost 20 years, no less.

915
58:06.546 --> 58:07.755
‎The law really favors

916
58:09.173 --> 58:10.383
‎people like me.

917
58:13.469 --> 58:15.471
‎I'm going to…

918
58:17.599 --> 58:18.975
‎bury you.

919
58:20.476 --> 58:21.519
‎Sure.

920
58:21.603 --> 58:23.354
‎At most, it'll be a year.

921
58:23.438 --> 58:28.026
‎Once you get out and wait three years, ‎you'll probably get your license back.

922
58:28.651 --> 58:29.902
‎But listen carefully.

923
58:31.404 --> 58:33.281
‎I swear on my own license

924
58:33.906 --> 58:35.116
‎that I'll get yours…

925
58:36.868 --> 58:38.911
‎revoked for good.

926
58:40.496 --> 58:42.123
‎Because of you,

927
58:42.206 --> 58:45.251
‎I had to let the most dangerous doctor ‎into my hospital.

928
58:47.670 --> 58:49.422
‎This person right here

929
58:50.214 --> 58:53.760
‎despises authority and answers to no one.

930
58:56.220 --> 58:57.263
‎Dr. Jo.

931
58:57.347 --> 58:59.432
‎You don't think Dr. Gye did it, do you?

932
59:02.894 --> 59:04.020
‎Ask her yourself.

933
59:05.313 --> 59:07.732
‎I don't think she did.

934
59:08.691 --> 59:13.196
‎You're going to pay ‎a heavy price for this.

935
59:17.450 --> 59:19.619
‎You'll be the first to go down, Director.

936
59:22.580 --> 59:24.123
‎My next visitor

937
59:24.707 --> 59:26.668
‎is a lawyer hired by Magnolia.

938
59:34.342 --> 59:35.218
‎I'm Mun Jeong-ho.

939
59:38.763 --> 59:40.181
‎You'll need it.

940
59:40.264 --> 59:43.768
‎I get the feeling the biggest threat ‎to you and the hospital is in the OR.

941
59:44.686 --> 59:46.396
‎I mean Gye Su-jeong.

942
59:47.438 --> 59:49.232
‎Her only weapons are her medical license

943
59:49.315 --> 59:52.235
‎and the surgical skills ‎she has honed from the bottom up.

944
59:52.944 --> 59:54.028
‎Why did you ask me that?

945
59:54.779 --> 59:56.072
‎Because I can't ask her.

946
59:56.739 --> 59:57.740
‎Seriously?

947
59:59.450 --> 01:00:00.576
‎I look forward to seeing

948
01:00:01.494 --> 01:00:03.496
‎how far Gye Su-jeong will go

949
01:00:03.579 --> 01:00:06.416
‎and how long you will last.

950
01:00:22.348 --> 01:00:24.851
‎PATHOLOGY REPORT ‎MR. NA DAE-IL

951
01:00:32.108 --> 01:00:33.151
‎You planned this, didn't you?

952
01:00:33.234 --> 01:00:34.861
‎You get your results next week, right?

953
01:00:35.445 --> 01:00:36.320
‎I can't wait.

954
01:00:36.904 --> 01:00:37.905
‎Don't worry.

955
01:00:37.989 --> 01:00:38.990
‎I…

956
01:00:40.408 --> 01:00:41.701
‎don't ever fail.

957
01:00:42.493 --> 01:00:43.953
‎PATHOLOGY REPORT

958
01:00:44.036 --> 01:00:47.874
‎RESULTS: BENIGN TUMOR, ‎NO ABNORMAL FINDINGS

959
01:01:02.138 --> 01:01:02.972
‎Listen carefully.

960
01:01:03.890 --> 01:01:07.477
‎That woman has eyes and ears ‎in every hospital in Korea.

961
01:01:08.186 --> 01:01:10.354
‎If you ever get sick or injured,

962
01:01:11.189 --> 01:01:13.524
‎I'll be the one to operate on you.

963
01:01:14.233 --> 01:01:17.403
‎No matter which hospital you go to, ‎or who examines you,

964
01:01:17.487 --> 01:01:20.114
‎I'll be the one who opens ‎and closes you up.

965
01:01:22.158 --> 01:01:24.494
‎I'll amuse myself ‎until you're ripped to shreds.

966
01:01:26.412 --> 01:01:27.371
‎You get it now, right?

967
01:01:28.247 --> 01:01:30.041
‎I'm more than capable of doing it.

968
01:01:35.379 --> 01:01:37.215
‎Hey, Gye Su-jeong!

969
01:01:40.426 --> 01:01:42.178
‎That damn Gye…

970
01:01:43.679 --> 01:01:45.056
‎Goddamn it.

971
01:01:46.808 --> 01:01:47.642
‎I mean…

972
01:01:51.270 --> 01:01:53.272
‎It's not like I killed anyone.

973
01:01:54.649 --> 01:01:57.068
‎I didn't take any damn drugs

974
01:01:57.985 --> 01:02:01.030
‎or get drunk, so why?

975
01:02:01.113 --> 01:02:02.573
‎Why the hell am I here?

976
01:02:04.909 --> 01:02:06.035
‎Why?

977
01:02:06.118 --> 01:02:08.412
‎What did I…

978
01:02:08.496 --> 01:02:10.998
‎What the hell did I do wrong?

979
01:02:14.210 --> 01:02:15.461
‎I can't ask her.

980
01:02:16.379 --> 01:02:18.256
‎I'm afraid she'll say,

981
01:02:19.382 --> 01:02:20.508
‎"I branded him."

982
01:02:48.828 --> 01:02:50.371
‎Meet Gye Su-jeong, a surgeon.

983
01:02:51.497 --> 01:02:52.582
‎Also known as

984
01:02:53.958 --> 01:02:55.751
‎Doctor X.

985
01:03:35.458 --> 01:03:38.377
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

986
01:03:39.045 --> 01:03:40.296
‎Do a surgery for us.

987
01:03:40.379 --> 01:03:41.756
‎We need you to remove a bullet.

988
01:03:41.839 --> 01:03:42.798
‎From here.

989
01:03:42.882 --> 01:03:45.927
‎-If she fails‎… ‎-We won't be responsible for that outcome.

990
01:03:46.010 --> 01:03:48.554
‎It'll be entirely on Dr. Gye and Ms. Jang.

991
01:03:48.638 --> 01:03:50.681
‎Who's going to do it? Who?

992
01:03:50.765 --> 01:03:51.641
‎I will!

993
01:03:51.724 --> 01:03:52.892
‎I'll operate.

994
01:03:52.975 --> 01:03:55.353
‎He had everyone there to set you up.

995
01:03:55.436 --> 01:03:56.854
‎To pin it on you if it goes wrong.

996
01:03:56.938 --> 01:03:58.189
‎I might fail.

997
01:03:58.272 --> 01:03:59.815
‎If I fail, you'll die.

998
01:03:59.899 --> 01:04:01.567
‎But will you be okay with it?

999
01:04:01.651 --> 01:04:02.902
‎Just existing like this?

1000
01:04:02.985 --> 01:04:05.780
‎What on earth happened that day?

1001
01:04:06.864 --> 01:04:11.869
‎Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim
